				\begin{document}$$ \Delta  E=\sqrt{{\left({L}_1-{L}_2\right)}^2+{\left({a}_1-{a}_2\right)}^2+{\left({b}_1-{b}_2\right)}^2} $$\end{document}∆E=L1−L22+a1−a22+b1−b22
